@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Alternative operations
+purge_permanently is an explicitly irreversible operation. It is not archive.
+scoped_cleanup operates on disposable build artifacts (ArtifactStore), not protected resources. It delegates name and environment selection to ArtifactStore.delete_named.
+Resources.remove_if_unprotected performs the protection check and deletion under the same lock used for protection updates.
+account_key is a standalone equivalent of normalize_account; it preserves stripping and Unicode case folding.
+save_at accepts an absolute deadline, not a duration.
+retry_after_failure is synchronous and deliberately delays one retry through an injected clock.
